# === Node ===
node_modules/
# Also ignore a `node_modules` SYMLINK (a file, not a dir) — the trailing-slash
# pattern above only matches directories, so a stray symlink could otherwise be
# committed (ORCH-1006: one was, and broke a checkout's node_modules).
node_modules

